{"kind":"request","text":"S3: configuration that fails closed and shows what is in force\n\nFrom the attack-surface review of 10 November 2026 (planner request\n79daff0f, at main 7177b87b). Read its sections 2.1, 2.3 and 2.4.\n\nOne head, with checker review.\n\n1. Finding 2.1. A Worker that an operator deploys by the steps of\n   docs/self-host-cloudflare.md admits no creation before its settings\n   are complete. Today a Worker with no `DEPLOYMENT` is local, and it\n   admits any parentless creation. Choose the smaller change that closes\n   the window: `DEPLOYMENT` in the template's vars, or a refusal unless\n   an explicit local flag is set. The note says which and why. In the\n   window, /health names the missing setting. Correct the order of the\n   steps in docs/self-host-cloudflare.md and docs/deploy.md.\n2. Finding 2.3. /health gains a member `policy` that names the index\n   mode, whether hosted MCP is open, and whether open creation is\n   allowed. It shows no secret and no setting value beyond those three.\n3. Finding 2.4, three parts. The comparison of `REGISTER_SCOPE` covers a\n   GitHub register. The Mac kit deploys with hosted MCP closed. celld\n   takes a caller's address from a header only when the request comes\n   from the tunnel, and the note says how it tells.\n\nWitness. A test for each item that fails at 7177b87b: settings `{}`\nrefuse a directory `found` (trace4.mjs in\n~/play/artroom-evidence/2026-11-10-attack-surface-review), /health\nshows `policy` for register mode and for enforce mode, a GitHub register\nthat differs from `REGISTER_SCOPE` is detected, and the kit's check\naccepts `MCP_ENABLED` unset.\n\nOrder. After the cutover family head. It lands before any public\nstatement that an operator can self-host.","body":{"conditions":"One head with checker review closes findings 2.1 and 2.3 and the three named parts of 2.4 of review 79daff0f, each with a test that fails at 7177b87b. The self-host pages give the corrected order.","target_head":"7177b87be03ced9e2ddae2a5ebfcdfffcc1fda62","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}